{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#card-zh","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-sessions 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话侧栏插件。宿主端记录本次进程启动时间并提供只读状态接口，客户端在侧栏页签注册表中加入“本次启动”面板。面板筛选启动后更新且非空白的会话，按活动时间排序并显示工作区与相对时间；还支持当前会话高亮、右键移除与恢复、拖拽排序以及中英文界面。移除和顺序保存在浏览器本地存储，并随进程启动重置。需要 DSH Web 服务和兼容的侧栏页签注册表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-40","lib/client.js:204-231","lib/client.js:801-865"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#card-en","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-run-sessions adds a “This run” tab to the DSH web sidebar. It lists nonblank sessions updated since startup, sorted by activity, and shows workspace and relative time. Users can hide, restore, and reorder sessions. It requires the DSH web server and a compatible sidebar tab registry.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:12-40","lib/client.js:204-231","lib/client.js:801-865"]}
