{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#feature-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-sessions 的功能「启动后会话筛选」：面板只列出启动时间之后更新且非空白的会话，并按最近更新时间排序；会话状态变化时列表随 store 更新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:204-231","lib/client.js:510-536"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#feature-2","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-sessions 的功能「会话侧栏页签」：插件向侧栏页签注册表插入“本次启动”面板，点击条目可打开会话，并尽量保持侧栏停留在该页签。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:801-865","lib/client.js:916-962"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#feature-3","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-sessions 的功能「列表整理与恢复」：会话可通过右键菜单从列表隐藏并一键恢复，也可拖拽调整顺序；隐藏项和顺序保存在 localStorage。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:330-435","lib/client.js:445-472"]}
{"unit_id":"ayachinene285__dsh-run-sessions#caveat-1","repo":"ayachinene285/dsh-run-sessions","commit":"95280abe54a862e476d24c0fa511f781649e9589","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-run-sessions 依赖兼容的侧栏页签注册表；找不到注册表时不会显示页签。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:740-755","lib/client.js:801-809"]}
